# GymBrain v1.0 – Build Complete 🧠

## What Was Built

The full GymBrain MVP was implemented from scratch across three layers.

---

## Engine Layer (`engine/`)

| File | What it does |
|------|-------------|
| [muscle/back.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/back.js) | 10 exercises, deadlift-last founder rule, time tiers |
| [muscle/chest.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/chest.js) | 9 exercises, compound-first ordering |
| [muscle/leg.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/leg.js) | 10 exercises, deduplication logic |
| [muscle/shoulders.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/shoulders.js) | Rear delt always included (founder rule) |
| [muscle/biceps.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/biceps.js) | 8 exercises including Chin-Ups |
| [muscle/triceps.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/muscle/triceps.js) | 8 exercises including Dips |
| [combo.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/combo.js) | Back+Bi / Chest+Tri / Legs+Shoulders with time-budget split |
| [swapEngine.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/swapEngine.js) | Muscle-overlap scorer across all 65+ exercises |
| [splits.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/splits.js) | Push / Pull / Legs / Full Body (Phase 2 ready) |
| [generator.js](file:///c:/kotlin%20prac/Personal%20Project/engine/generator.js) | Master router for single / combo / split modes |

**Time Awareness:**
| Time | Plan |
|------|------|
| 60+ min | Full coverage (5+ exercises) |
| 40–50 | Primary + secondary |
| 25–35 | Essential compounds only |
| <25 | Best single movement |

---

## Server Layer (`server/`)

| Route | Method | Description |
|-------|--------|-------------|
| `/generate` | POST | Accepts `{ mode, target, time, equipment }` → plan array |
| `/swap` | POST | Accepts `{ exercise, equipment }` → best substitute |
| `/log` | POST | Saves session to Supabase `workout_logs` |
| `/history` | GET | Returns last 10 logs for a user |
| `/test` | GET | DB health check |

---

## Frontend (`web/src/`)

**User flow:** Home → Muscle Select or Combo Select → Time Input → Equipment Selector → Workout Plan → Log Screen → History

| Screen | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| Home | `/` | Mode selector (Single / Combo) |
| MuscleSelect | `/single` | Pick back/chest/legs/shoulders/biceps/triceps |
| ComboSelect | `/combo` | Back+Bi / Chest+Tri / Legs+Shoulders |
| TimeInput | `/time` | Slider + quick pick, shows adaptive mode label |
| EquipmentSelector | `/equipment` | Checklist → triggers `/generate` |
| WorkoutPlan | `/workout` | Plan cards with 🔄 Busy swap button per exercise |
| SwapModal | (component) | Bottom sheet → calls `/swap`, confirms in place |
| LogScreen | `/log` | Session summary + notes → calls `/log` |
| HistoryScreen | `/history` | Past sessions from `/history` |

---

## Verification

- ✅ `npm run build` (Vite) — **passed, built in 2.21s, 0 errors**
- ✅ Frontend dev server running on `http://localhost:5173`
- ✅ Backend dev server running on `http://localhost:5000`
- ✅ **Full browser walkthrough completed — all 8 screens functional**

### Generated Plan (Back + Biceps, 45 min, Barbell + Dumbbell + Pull-up Bar)

| # | Exercise | Sets | Reps |
|---|----------|------|------|
| 1 | Pullups | 4 | 8-12 |
| 2 | Barbell Row | 4 | 8-10 |
| 3 | Barbell Curl | 4 | 8-12 |
| 4 | **Deadlift** 🔵 | 3 | 8→5→3 |

> Deadlift correctly placed **last** — founder preference ✅

### Swap Logic Test
> Busy exercise: **Pullups** → Suggested swap: **Chin-Ups** (same lat + bicep muscles, same pullup bar equipment) ✅

